# CycleReceipt schema (boat-2026-05-17 operating receipts)
# Record-judgment reading (premath.record-judgments.v0): this schema
# file is a COMPILED ARTIFACT per RJ-1.6 — the statement is the type,
# this file is data, never executable authority. Directive law map:
# require = telescope extension premise (RJ-1.1 shape);
# enum / literal / enum_prefix = atomic-predicate membership (RJ-1.5).
# Vocabulary divergence flagged 2026-06-09: the charter names seven threshold
# outcomes (admit transform split escrow defer archive reject) but the cycle
# tooling accepts only the three below. Successor charter should reconcile.
header CycleReceipt
require receipt_id
require cycle_id
require cargo
require source
require selected_material
require left_behind
require owner
require authority_surface
require predicate
require predicate_absence_reason
require projection_surface
require verification_boundary
require shore_commitment
require threshold_outcome
require disposition
require recorder
require receipt_ref
literal recorder Tusk
literal predicate_absence_reason none
enum threshold_outcome admit transform split
enum_prefix shore_commitment landed archived handed_off abandoned superseded
